ойной и размеренной жизни. Но на следующий же день, находит у себя на ранчо трупы женщин, убитых странным образом. Возможно, в несчастья, которые захлестнули город вовлечены паранормальные силы. Сможет ли шериф докопаться до правды?","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"104894","ru":"小鳥たちのいない花園","en":"小鳥たちのいない花園","year":"1992","type":"Фильм","rating":4.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wbSCK7bKziQrSB0vYZSR2aTJ9I7.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m6Q47za3W95i8NWcJjmRpqqmuHD.jpg","genres":["ужасы"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"554776","ru":"정사 : 처제의 사랑","en":"정사 : 처제의 사랑","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":4.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4roDAaF9Kpvd9ob6XLkoCRoDLkn.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i5xLukHWqHbJaFO1T4yIZb34uOf.jpg","genres":["драма","мелодрама"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"416309","ru":"驚心破","en":"驚心破","year":"2016","type":"Фильм","rating":4.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bfdUB3ckbeAOWzgOaYx482jcF3Q.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gVXb8AoPz6fI3IAUBiZjkak2Wpj.jpg","genres":["криминал"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"251898","ru":"ஆஹா கல்யாணம்","en":"ஆஹா கல்யாணம்","year":"2014","type":"Фильм","rating":4.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/goLTOX7DwyQ3dyVQGaTSFpV8enm.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ev9Gf7fYl1rQNBlDkEslv0438Z4.jpg","genres":["мелодрама","комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"429296","ru":"Svingeri","en":"Svingeri","year":"2016","type":"Фильм","rating":4.9,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fIqUPqAtgcQNLobHws7gJTLD5Iv.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/28lSnWCODA8NDZD6QEZ0